or","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record since 1951 has February to March, August to September and October to November each under 90% of normal in 34 of 75 years on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids. In 2025 on that middle, August to September came in at 51% of normal and September to October at 58%. For 2026 so far, March to April ran 183% of normal on the middle. Grid 26886 had its driest year in 1963 at 61% of normal.</p>"}
